1
00:00:27,519 --> 00:00:30,000
What the hell are you staring at?

2
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:45,239
Why the hell am I sleeping here?
I'm supposed to sleep in my room.

3
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:48,715
What the hell happened?

4
00:00:48,715 --> 00:00:50,440
You were drunk. Super drunk.

5
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:55,880
I don't remember a damn thing.

6
00:00:56,848 --> 00:00:59,821
What the hell is going on?

7
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:02,095
Earth—what the hell happened?

8
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,553
How would I know?
I have class. I'm going to shower.

9
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:15,530
Hey—E–Earth! You little brat!

10
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:21,080
My head is killing me…

11
00:01:27,395 --> 00:01:29,340
I'm screwed.

12
00:01:30,495 --> 00:01:32,400
Yes, Mom. I'm at the university.

13
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:36,400
Huh? Did it break or what?

14
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:44,025
Oh—no, nothing's wrong, Mom.

15
00:01:47,913 --> 00:01:51,104
He made me sleep in the same room as him.

16
00:01:57,079 --> 00:01:58,879
I don't want to get close
to him at all, Mom…
